<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Strict//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-strict.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en">
<head>
<meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="content-type" />
<title>ClyvoVet_Default_Suite_v5</title>
</head>
<body>
<table cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" border="1">
<thead>
<tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="3" data-tags="">TC02_Login_Invalido</td></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>open</td><td>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/login<datalist><option>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/login</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>1500<datalist><option>1500</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=username<datalist><option>id=username</option></datalist></td><td>vini</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=password<datalist><option>id=password</option></datalist></td><td>123</td></tr>
<tr><td>click</td><td>xpath=//button[@type='submit']<datalist><option>xpath=//button[@type='submit']</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>2000<datalist><option>2000</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>assertElementPresent</td><td>id=username<datalist><option>id=username</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>assertElementNotPresent</td><td>link=Pets<datalist><option>link=Pets</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<table cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" border="1">
<thead>
<tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="3" data-tags="">TC01_Login_Valido</td></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>open</td><td>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/login<datalist><option>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/login</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>1500<datalist><option>1500</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=username<datalist><option>id=username</option></datalist></td><td>vini</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=password<datalist><option>id=password</option></datalist></td><td>123456</td></tr>
<tr><td>click</td><td>xpath=//button[@type='submit']<datalist><option>xpath=//button[@type='submit']</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>2000<datalist><option>2000</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>assertElementPresent</td><td>link=Pets<datalist><option>link=Pets</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>assertElementNotPresent</td><td>id=username<datalist><option>id=username</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<table cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" border="1">
<thead>
<tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="3" data-tags="">TC03_Criar_Atendimento</td></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>open</td><td>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/consultas/nova<datalist><option>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/consultas/nova</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>1500<datalist><option>1500</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>select</td><td>id=idPet<datalist><option>id=idPet</option></datalist></td><td>value=3</td></tr>
<tr><td>select</td><td>id=idClinica<datalist><option>id=idClinica</option></datalist></td><td>value=1</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=dataConsulta<datalist><option>id=dataConsulta</option></datalist></td><td>2030-01-12</td></tr>
<tr><td>select</td><td>id=tipoConsulta<datalist><option>id=tipoConsulta</option></datalist></td><td>value=EXAME</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=veterinario<datalist><option>id=veterinario</option></datalist></td><td>Eduardo Mollo</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=observacoes<datalist><option>id=observacoes</option></datalist></td><td>Exame relacionado a pata com bolhas</td></tr>
<tr><td>click</td><td>xpath=//button[contains(.,'Agendar')]<datalist><option>xpath=//button[contains(.,'Agendar')]</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>2000<datalist><option>2000</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>assertElementNotPresent</td><td>id=idPet<datalist><option>id=idPet</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>verifyTextPresent</td><td>Eduardo Mollo<datalist><option>Eduardo Mollo</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<table cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" border="1">
<thead>
<tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="3" data-tags="">TC04_Novo_Pet</td></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>open</td><td>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/pets/novo<datalist><option>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/pets/novo</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>1500<datalist><option>1500</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=nome<datalist><option>id=nome</option></datalist></td><td>Luquinhas</td></tr>
<tr><td>select</td><td>id=especie<datalist><option>id=especie</option></datalist></td><td>value=CACHORRO</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=raca<datalist><option>id=raca</option></datalist></td><td>Labrador</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=dataNascimento<datalist><option>id=dataNascimento</option></datalist></td><td>2020-03-15</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=pesoKg<datalist><option>id=pesoKg</option></datalist></td><td>26</td></tr>
<tr><td>select</td><td>id=sexo<datalist><option>id=sexo</option></datalist></td><td>value=MACHO</td></tr>
<tr><td>select</td><td>id=castrado<datalist><option>id=castrado</option></datalist></td><td>value=false</td></tr>
<tr><td>select</td><td>id=idTutor<datalist><option>id=idTutor</option></datalist></td><td>value=1</td></tr>
<tr><td>select</td><td>id=idClinicaPrincipal<datalist><option>id=idClinicaPrincipal</option></datalist></td><td>value=2</td></tr>
<tr><td>storeEval</td><td>new Date().getTime()<datalist><option>new Date().getTime()</option></datalist></td><td>microchip</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=microchip<datalist><option>id=microchip</option></datalist></td><td>${microchip}</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=observacoes<datalist><option>id=observacoes</option></datalist></td><td>Cachorro dócil, mas tomar cuidado pois não está castrado</td></tr>
<tr><td>click</td><td>xpath=//button[contains(.,'Salvar')]<datalist><option>xpath=//button[contains(.,'Salvar')]</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>2000<datalist><option>2000</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>assertElementNotPresent</td><td>id=idClinicaPrincipal<datalist><option>id=idClinicaPrincipal</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>verifyTextPresent</td><td>Luquinhas<datalist><option>Luquinhas</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<table cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" border="1">
<thead>
<tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="3" data-tags="">TC05_Prescrever_Medicamento</td></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>open</td><td>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/consultas?status=CONCLUIDA<datalist><option>https://clyvovet.vercel.app/consultas?status=CONCLUIDA</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>1500<datalist><option>1500</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>click</td><td>link=Abrir<datalist><option>link=Abrir</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>1500<datalist><option>1500</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>click</td><td>link=Prescrever medicamento<datalist><option>link=Prescrever medicamento</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>1500<datalist><option>1500</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=nome<datalist><option>id=nome</option></datalist></td><td>Carprofeno</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=principioAtivo<datalist><option>id=principioAtivo</option></datalist></td><td>Anti-inflamatório não esteroidal (AINE)</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=dosagem<datalist><option>id=dosagem</option></datalist></td><td>75mg</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=frequencia<datalist><option>id=frequencia</option></datalist></td><td>a cada 12 horas</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=dataFim<datalist><option>id=dataFim</option></datalist></td><td>2030-12-02</td></tr>
<tr><td>type</td><td>id=observacoes<datalist><option>id=observacoes</option></datalist></td><td>Administrar junto ou logo após as refeições para evitar desconforto gástrico. Manter água limpa e fresca sempre à disposição. Suspender o uso e contatar o veterinário caso observe vômitos, fezes escuras ou perda de apetite.</td></tr>
<tr><td>click</td><td>xpath=//button[contains(.,'Prescrever')]<datalist><option>xpath=//button[contains(.,'Prescrever')]</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>pause</td><td>2000<datalist><option>2000</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>assertElementNotPresent</td><td>id=dosagem<datalist><option>id=dosagem</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>verifyTextPresent</td><td>Carprofeno<datalist><option>Carprofeno</option></datalist></td><td></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
</body>
</html>